                <pb facs="0386" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg298"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Herbert.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-08-18"><hi rendition="#italic">August 18,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>When may I expect you here or note on canal tolls’?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John W. Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
